Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:05.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Where shall we go this autumn?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:09.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And so, after school, I'll be going with \NTani-kun to get a sweet potato parfait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.12,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,You're forcing that fall feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:13.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm happy to go on \Na date in our uniforms!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.45,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,But you two are always walking \Nhome together, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:16.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:19.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is our first time riding \Na train together in our uniforms!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:21.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We usually walk home together, \Nyes, but today is a {\i1}date{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:23.96,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Wait, you're taking a train \Njust for potatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:25.17,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,PotatoTrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:29.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And while we're out, \Nif luck is on my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:31.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to take some photo stickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:31.64,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos(145,103)\fad(355,1)\bord0\c&H4BEDE3&\fnTrebuchet MS}IN OUR\NUNIFORMS...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:34.51,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&HFAA9A0&\3c&HF065F6&\pos(351,143)\fad(550,1)}FLOWERS IN A MIRROR,\NMOON ON THE WATER
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:34.06,Italics,Watanabe; Satou,0,0,0,,A photo sticker printing booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:37.73,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,When you first started dating,\Ntaking a photo together was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:38.27,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs16\pos(43,64)\fad(351,358)\c&H7A1FE4&\3c&HF9D8FF&}THIS IS...\NGROWTH(?)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:40.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Photos take getting used to, \Nand I've kinda given up, in a way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:43.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but I've always liked \Ntaking photo stickers. Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:46.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm super cute with all those filters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:45.40,Basic Sign,SIGN; PURI,0,0,0,,{\pos(547,72)\frz348\c&HEF8D30&\bord1\fad(275,314)}PHOTO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:51.03,Basic Sign,SIGN; PURI,0,0,0,,{\c&HBD29C4&\bord1\fad(350,1)\pos(543,68)\frz346.9}STICKER
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:48.15,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,How dignified and bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:50.28,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Don't give up on the real live Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:08.26,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,115)\fnArial}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.62,0:02:24.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Potato! Potato! Sweet potato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:26.67,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Potato! Potato! Sweet potato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:29.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Potato! Potato! Roasted sweet potato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:30.55,Default - Top,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh, hey! Suzuki and Tani \Nare at the train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:31.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey! Azu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:34.72,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Could this be one of those \Nschool uniform dates?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.47,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,How nice for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:39.89,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,How nice for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:41.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You said it twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:43.48,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,For now, let's all take \Na picture together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:44.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:46.35,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,So suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.98,0:02:48.65,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Tani looks displeased.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:49.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:51.07,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.07,0:02:54.40,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I was wondering why, because we see \Neach other at school, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But it's a different situation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:58.87,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,It's like a diary entry, \Nor making a note, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:02:59.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.66,0:03:02.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Photos are an external \Nhard drive for memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:08.00,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,When I look back at it, I want to remember \Nthat this day was our first date,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:12.05,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,that we had a lot of fun, that my \Nheart was racing... stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:14.55,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Like a keepsake. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:19.55,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H78D810&\fnTrebuchet MS\fad(101,1)}COMPREHENSION
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:16.13,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:17.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:19.01,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,That was enough to convince him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:19.55,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(191,1)\c&HCDC950&\an7}HOW FUNNY
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.56,Basic Sign,SIGN; split,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HADFDFE&\3c&H7C018E&\4c&H7C018E&\shad1\fs36}BOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.56,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs36\c&HD77AC9&\3c&H5D2D5E&}SWEET POTATO!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:24.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yay! It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:28.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'll take one with you in it, Tani-kun. \NMake some kind of pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:29.94,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,A pose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:32.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hand powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:36.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.82,Basic Sign,SIGN; box,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\bord1\pos(138.667,275.333)}PRETEND\NGOURMET REPORTING
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:39.82,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's super sweet potato-y, \Nbut not too cloying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.20,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's the sweetness of happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:45.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:45.45,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs32\fad(438,1)\c&H9FDCF9&\3c&H2F2B75&}MELTYYYY...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.46,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs32\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HC2FDA2&\3c&H6D8818&\fad(355,313)}CHOMP...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:54.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Wait, did you just take a photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:58.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I just know I was making \Na weird face! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:01.10,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I thought we wanted to save \Nour memories for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:04.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I don't want any weird photos \Nof me on your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:06.85,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What? That's so self-centered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:08.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:13.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Say, Yuusuke-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:14.73,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HE727A5&\pos(380.667,36.667)\frz22.42\fad(357,1)\an8}CUTESY...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:17.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I have one more self-centered request.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:20.99,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HACF5FB&\3c&HA5C418&\fs36\an8\fad(186,1)}BOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:23.16,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,Look at this one! Isn't it great?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:23.87,Default - Top,crowd,0,0,0,,I'm in love with this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:28.79,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I want to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:34.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yuusuke-san, have you ever participated \Nin the act of printing photos as stickers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:34.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Are you okay with me picking one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:38.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If one interests you, just say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:40.59,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You already know the answer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.47,0:04:42.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I guess you caught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.01,Italics,machine; female,0,0,0,,Okay, let's pose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.77,Italics,machine; female,0,0,0,,Make a heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:47.52,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.85,Italics,machine; female,0,0,0,,Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:53.98,Italics,machine; female,0,0,0,,Make a cute kitty pose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.15,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.15,0:04:58.11,Italics,machine; female,0,0,0,,Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:00.53,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:01.36,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:04.66,Italics,machine; female,0,0,0,,Next, grab each others' chins, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:05.49,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.79,0:05:09.62,Italics,machine; female,0,0,0,,Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:10.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,J-Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:22.18,Italics,machine; female,0,0,0,,All right! Now, next...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:24.47,Italics,machine; female,0,0,0,,both of you, smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:28.39,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:31.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's hot in those photo \Nsticker machines, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.19,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,There's that too, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:38.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you! I'm super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:43.57,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What should I do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:47.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to put it up in my room, \Nbut my mom will see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.45,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs18\c&H585857&\3c&HEFEFEF&\fad(148,1)\an8\pos(492.667,153.333)}STICKER HIDING SPOT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:53.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'll make an album with the\N photos and share it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:54.33,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:04.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, you added some, Tani-kun? \NThank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:06.22,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs36\an7\c&H7E3DD5&\fad(143,1)}SHOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:09.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wait! Please delete this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.35,0:06:10.47,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Don't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:16.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The corrections didn't apply to \NTani-kun at all, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:19.48,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos(250,30)\an8\fad(229,1)\c&HADDD23&\3c&HE6F38A&\bord1}BECAUSE HE\NHAS GLASSES...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.48,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fad(229,1)\c&H9B56EE&\3c&HF4BEF1&\bord1\pos(71.333,153.667)}THE PROCESSING
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:18.32,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,It's too unbalanced, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:22.24,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4D50EA&\fs36\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\an8\pos(275,40)\frz26.59\frx16\fry346}RAMEN
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:22.24,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Manager, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:23.99,Default,manager,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:32.00,Basic Sign,SIGN; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnArial\fs12\b0\3c&HB4FFB0&\frz2.007\pos(390,187)}NO ANSWER
