Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:32.00,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnArial\fs12\b0\3c&HFBFBFB&\c&H8F8F8F&\pos(305.333,352.333)\frz3.106}HOW'VE YOU BEEN? LOL
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:34.87,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,A blast from the past! He's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:40.50,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H373538&\3c&HECDFB3&\bord1\move(9,310,99,310,1,224)}Commentary
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.87,0:06:38.59,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,They dated for a while, but for some \Nreason, he suddenly broke off contact.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.59,0:06:40.50,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,This message is from an ex-boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:45.01,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,What's the "lol" for? \NCan't he say he's sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:47.39,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Male pride is such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:51.43,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,I guess it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:52.56,Basic Sign,SIGN; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnArial\fs12\b0\3c&HB4FFB0&\frz2.007\move(390,187,380,90,522,649)\fad(1,148)}NO ANSWER
