Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:56.40,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnArial\fs12\b0\3c&HFBFBFB&\c&H8F8F8F&\frz3.106\move(289,248,281,174,1233,1483)}HOW'VE YOU BEEN? LOL
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:56.40,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HC197F4&\3c&H9458CC&\bord1\frz9.159\move(447,260,437,186,1233,1483)}Doin' Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:56.40,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnArial\fs12\b0\3c&HB4FFB0&\frz4.385\move(415,375,410,333,1,183)}HOW HAVE YOU BEEN?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.40,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:07:00.15,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,If someone you used to know well \Nmessages you after a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:02.78,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,your heart brightens for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:07.41,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,but then you notice you don't click \Nand it all feels like a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:10.58,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,And you think, "That's right. \NThat's why it didn't work out,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:12.91,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,and come back to reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:16.46,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,How many more times am \NI going to repeat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:20.17,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&HA7505F&\frz11.77\pos(470.667,30.667)\an8\fad(603,1)}GLOOM...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Azu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:20.17,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I can't sympathize at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:22.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Why do you let them get away with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:26.51,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, but let's \Noverwrite it with fun stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.51,0:07:28.51,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,That straightforwardness \Nof yours is a lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:30.97,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Romance isn't all there is to school life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:32.10,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:33.60,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Let's all go bowling together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:36.64,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I want to go bowling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.44,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just the mood you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:41.11,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I want to throw something heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:42.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I feel like the objective has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.45,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(138,219.333)\fnTrebuchet MS}WEEKEND
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.03,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Then, on the weekend...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:49.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Azuma says her train's running a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:47.86,Default - Top,Watanabe; background,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm taking it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:49.45,Default - Top,Yamada; background,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:52.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I thought that TairAzuma \Nwould come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:54.54,Default - Top,Taira,0,0,0,,Don't smash our names\Ntogether like they're English.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.45,Basic Sign,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\c&H7A11E1&\frz2.386\fs16\pos(311,243)\fad(232,1)}HO-DON
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:54.45,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom,0,0,0,,{\c&H7A11E1&\frz2.386\fs16\pos(330,320)\fad(232,1)}TAIRAZUMA
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:56.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But don't you get on at the same station?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:57.75,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,You numskull!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.75,0:08:01.50,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,If anyone from my neighborhood \Nsaw us meeting up at the station...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:03.59,Default - Top,neighborhood girl A,0,0,0,,Azuma, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:05.46,Default - Top,neighborhood girl B,0,0,0,,What caused this particular combo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:07.22,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:08.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, Azu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:11.93,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Just thinking about it makes me \Nbreak out in a cold sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:11.47,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(502,26)\an8\c&HB2790A&\fad(269,230)}SHUDDER...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:15.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, is this your first time bowling?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.89,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I've only bowled once a really \Nlong time ago with a kids' group.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:20.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If there's anything you \Ndon't get, I'll teach you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:23.90,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Incidentally, I hear the shoes are \N ugly as an antitheft measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:24.98,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Is that vital info?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:26.11,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,They're huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:28.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Everyone, what's your average?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:29.45,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,A hundred and eighty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:30.82,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,A hundred and seventy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:31.91,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,A hundred and thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:33.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,How dare you, Taira.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:33.95,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.95,0:08:35.79,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,If I hit a hundred, I feel pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.04,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:39.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And mine's fifty, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.12,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,So you're the worst player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:44.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Now then, I think fifteen should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.63,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Don't do the Ripper Cyclotron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:50.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Taira, your reactions are so funny.\NIt makes all the goofing around worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:51.84,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:55.68,Default - Top,crowd,0,0,0,,Yeah! Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:03.15,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Former classmates from my neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:05.90,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,They think our neighborhood's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:12.16,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HC090F4&\3c&H692EB0&\move(629,206,525,206,1,271)}I <3 OUR\N{\c&H641DB1&\bord1\3c&HFFFFFF&}NEIGHBORHOOD
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.90,0:09:07.82,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,They're still all hanging out together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:09.78,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,If I don't look, \Nmaybe they won't notice me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:11.82,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,They wouldn't remember me anyway, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:16.66,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,But Azuma got along pretty well \Nwith them, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:23.29,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I don't want to get involved with \Nthem when I'm with these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:24.92,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.84,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,They won't try to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:27.63,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:30.17,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I think they'll pretend that \Nthey haven't noticed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:33.01,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Not that I really mind, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:35.18,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I hope they're happy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:37.39,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.35,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. Let's have some fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:46.90,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:51.70,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs32\i1\c&H7300D8&\bord1}WHOOSH
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, that's amazing! \NYou have a talent for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:03.46,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,That reaction just for a spare?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:13.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Okay! See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:15.51,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,See you at school!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:20.77,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,It says the next train is in ten minutes. \NThat's a long time between trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:25.73,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,It's not likely I'll run into \Nthose guys from earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:28.73,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hey, those guys we saw today...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:32.36,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Weren't you in that same group \Nback in middle school?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.82,0:10:34.74,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:38.37,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was, but things \Nare a little complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:40.66,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,So, 1 is my ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:48.13,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HBB5C10&\pos(71.333,34)}EX
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:43.96,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Another, 2, well, a lot happened, \Nbut it doesn't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:48.13,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H8AB216&\pos(298.667,38.667)}Doesn't count
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:48.13,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,And the two girls that were with them \Nare their current girlfriends, 3 and 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:50.00,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,What did she just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:51.13,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\fnArial\fs16\pos(533,288)\fade(228,1)}WAS\NTHAT\NJAPANESE?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:52.46,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:55.30,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,So, there was dating and \Nbreaking up in the group,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:58.68,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,and you're the ex-girlfriend, \Nso it's awkward now. Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:04.89,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mind, personally, \Nbut they seem to feel guilty about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:09.69,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,When 1 suddenly sent me \Na break-up message,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:23.37,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HBB5C10&\pos(544,47)}EX
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:12.44,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,just a little while later, \Nhe started dating 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.69,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,She's calling them by number?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:17.78,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,And 2 and I clearly had a good vibe going, \Nso I wondered why he suddenly ghosted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:23.37,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,But he was dating 4, and I was like, \N"You approached us both at the same time?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.62,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,It's all sort of... delicate, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:35.72,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,That's absolutely sickening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:39.26,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I've got massive chills for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:43.89,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,How can they just shuffle partners\Nwithin the same community?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:48.40,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Add in the awkwardness that's \Ncreated by all of it, and it's just gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:52.19,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,But actually, when I went \Nto the bathroom, I ran into 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:54.19,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,and she was like, \N"Oh, hey, long time no see!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:59.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\frz16.9\fs20\fad(356,1)\move(476,189,323,131,1858,2108)\c&HB25310&}SO IT'S\NNOT REALLY\NALL THAT DIRE...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.53,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,It was pretty easy to just talk normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:59.78,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.07,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You know, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:03.03,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Whoa, 1 just sent something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:08.29,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnArial\fs20\b0\3c&HDCC48C&\c&HFFFFFF&\frz8.058\pos(507.333,80)}UNREAD MESSAGES BELOW
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:08.29,Basic Sign,SIGN; bubble,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnArial\fs20\b0\3c&HFBFBFB&\c&H000000&\frz8.163\pos(435.333,259.334)}YOU WENT BOWLING\NTODAY, RIGHT? LOL
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:08.29,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HB65D11&\3c&HF3E1BC&\pos(215,250)}EX (1)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.37,0:12:06.12,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,"You went bowling today, right? lol" \N...is what he sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:08.29,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What? He's shameless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:12.25,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,His intentions are so blatant\Nthat it ends up hilarious, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:14.55,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:15.80,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.05,0:12:19.80,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,While we've been talking... \NNo, actually, before that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.05,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,That ex-boyfriend with his sloppy texts...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:24.93,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,and that girl who made a calculated \Nmove to act like your friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:28.06,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,and this guy who might be taking \Nthis opportunity to go after you again...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:31.19,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Not one of them has faced you head-on \Nor squared things with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:33.57,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,But none of them have the guts \Nto just be the bad guy either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.57,0:12:35.48,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,They're way too disrespectful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:38.32,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You're being treated like trash, \Nso you should get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.28,0:12:41.41,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You're the only one getting \Nworn down here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.53,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,There's no way it's worth it, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:53.84,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,But, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:59.59,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Once I like someone, I can't really \Nbring myself to hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:04.72,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Like, even if stuff happens, \NI decide it's fine, and I forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:08.31,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh. That's why they \Ntreat me like trash, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:14.44,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,So, if you don't hate them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:18.24,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,then you have to just forgive and \Naccept all their bad parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:20.70,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,That's not right, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:31.37,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,The things that've always nagged at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:36.88,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,I've never put them into words like \NTaira and really thought about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:38.76,Flashback Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,I guess it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:41.13,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Why do you let them get away with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:46.30,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not about being treated badly, \Nor having no luck with men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:51.27,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm not taking care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:01.86,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Taira, thanks for yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:01.86,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:03.74,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:05.32,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.12,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I was so arrogant,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:09.95,Basic Sign,SIGN; top arc,0,0,0,,{\frz18.47\pos(126,42)\c&H5BFFDA&\3c&H663711&\bord1\fad(475,1)}AAAAAAAA...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:09.95,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\frz16.39\pos(213.334,200.667)\c&HB4FFFF&\3c&H90451E&\fad(475,1)}YESTERDAY'S BAD MOOD TAIRA
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:09.95,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,and started telling you\N what to say to other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.33,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I pushed my opinion on you.\NIf it were me, I'd get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.29,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I can only talk\Nbecause I'm an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:15.96,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,When I see the malignant side of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.09,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,there's this spite in me \Nthat I can't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:20.09,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's like a craving to point it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:21.46,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,A craving to point it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:24.05,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Talking about a theory\Nmight have been okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:29.01,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,but later I realized how wrong assuming \Nthat {\i1}I{\i0} knew what you thought and felt was.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.51,0:14:30.10,Default - Top,Azuma,0,0,0,,Um, yeah. Okay. I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:30.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HA34BF6&\an7\fad(273,1)}OH, IT'S TAYLAZUMA
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:31.89,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\c&H93CD14&\fs30\an9\fad(1,228)}GLOOM...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:31.85,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&H9447EA&\pos(118,66)\fad(100,63)}SNEAK
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:33.23,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&H9447EA&\pos(84,96)\fad(106,67)}SNEAK...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:34.14,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:34.60,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&H9447EA&\pos(118,66)\fad(103,60)}SNEAK
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:36.06,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:36.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Forgive what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:38.06,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(209,40)\c&H86186F&\fad(481,1)}MORNING!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:41.74,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:45.95,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Your brother and father are both\Ngoing to be away this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:47.24,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(464,51)\fad(1642,1)\c&H7F30EA&}WHISPER...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:47.24,Basic Sign,SIGN; right face; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fs12\frz14.92\bord1\c&HA71AA4&\pos(282.666,140.666)\fad(183,1)}SANDLOT BASEBALL
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:47.24,Basic Sign,SIGN; left face; top,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs12\bord1\shad1\c&HF1D8F6&\3c&H9F467C&\4c&H9F467C&\pos(172,35.333)\frz14.92\fad(183,1)}BROTHER
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:47.24,Basic Sign,SIGN; left face; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fs12\frz14.92\bord1\c&HA71AA4&\pos(194.666,156.666)\fad(183,1)}SLEEPOVER
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:47.24,Basic Sign,SIGN; right face; top,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs12\bord1\shad1\c&HF1D8F6&\3c&H9F467C&\4c&H9F467C&\frz14.92\fad(183,1)\pos(255.333,25.333)}DAD
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:50.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry this was so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:52.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wasn't it sort of far without your bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:54.75,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's supposed to rain today, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:56.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:57.96,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's just my grandma's intuition, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:14:58.50,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(74,32)\fad(232,1)\an8\c&H90FFFD&\3c&HA4A777&}HERE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:03.92,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Oh! Ordering delivery during the \Nday for a good reason is just so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:01.50,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\frz30.57\pos(185,44)\c&HC6FFB1&\3c&H98892D&\4c&H98892D&\bord1\shad1}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:02.01,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\bord1\shad1\pos(435.667,42.667)\frz344.7\c&HF4AAFE&\3c&H660A85&\4c&H660A85&}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.01,0:15:02.51,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\frz30.57\pos(185,44)\c&HC6FFB1&\3c&H98892D&\4c&H98892D&\bord1\shad1}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:02.96,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\bord1\shad1\pos(435.667,42.667)\frz344.7\c&HF4AAFE&\3c&H660A85&\4c&H660A85&}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:03.51,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\frz30.57\pos(185,44)\c&HC6FFB1&\3c&H98892D&\4c&H98892D&\bord1\shad1}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:03.97,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\bord1\shad1\pos(435.667,42.667)\frz344.7\c&HF4AAFE&\3c&H660A85&\4c&H660A85&}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:04.51,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\frz30.57\pos(185,44)\c&HC6FFB1&\3c&H98892D&\4c&H98892D&\bord1\shad1}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:04.97,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\bord1\shad1\pos(435.667,42.667)\frz344.7\c&HF4AAFE&\3c&H660A85&\4c&H660A85&}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.97,0:15:05.26,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\frz30.57\pos(185,44)\c&HC6FFB1&\3c&H98892D&\4c&H98892D&\bord1\shad1\fad(1,240)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:08.51,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Welcome home! Tani-kun, welcome to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:11.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um, this is Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:12.72,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:17.73,Italics,Suzuki's mom; internal,0,0,0,,He seems like he's been \Nbrought up very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:20.77,Basic Sign,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\an7\c&HC17FF5&\fs20\fad(480,1)\3c&H16315B&\4c&H16315B&\shad1}SUZUKI'S\N{\c&H355FF1&}OLDER\NBROTHER
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:20.77,Basic Sign,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\an9\fs20\fad(480,1)\c&HA5FFFE&\3c&H16315B&\4c&H16315B&\shad1}AND {\c&HBE7EF5&}HIS\NHOMIES {\c&HA2FFFD&}FROM\N{\c&H3261F2&}THE HOOD
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:20.77,Basic Sign,SIGN; box,0,0,0,,{\fs16\b0\fnArial\c&H164C61&\bord1\3c&HA7FFFE&\pos(320,285)}THE YOUNG MEN SHE'S SEEN UP UNTIL NOW
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.73,0:15:18.86,Flashback,Suzuki's brother's friend A,0,0,0,,Thanks for havin' me!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.86,0:15:20.44,Flashback,Suzuki's brother's friend B,0,0,0,,Hiya, auntie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:23.19,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Please, right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:24.07,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs32\i1\c&HC48E09&}GULP...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:26.95,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, whereabouts is your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:27.70,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,The neighborhood next—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:30.12,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Oh, you must be tired \Nafter walking all that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:32.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Mom, please don't talk over him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:35.41,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,If there's any food you don't like, \Nyou don't have to force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.42,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,After all, I'm not the one who made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:39.58,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,She didn't need to say that last part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:39.29,Default - Top,Tani; background,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.80,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, do you have a favorite food?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:43.92,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Oh! I should have \Nasked that ahead of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.93,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you keep asking questions like that, \Nhe won't be able to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.93,0:15:48.43,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Oh, how rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:53.43,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs32\an8\c&HC9BA54&\fad(479,1)}SILENCE...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:55.48,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Should I put on some music?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.44,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Maybe something like \NOFFICIAL HIGE DANSHAKU?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:58.65,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Young people like them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:16:00.81,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Mom! Please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.07,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,I'll bring some snacks up later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:05.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:10.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Come in. Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:15.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. My mom is nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:16.45,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,She's nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:18.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes. By the look of it, very nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.46,0:16:22.71,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I'm saying it right, but she \Nmade me go, "Yes, this is Suzuki's mom."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.71,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Do you mean that in a good way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:26.67,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:31.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! It really did start raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.59,0:16:34.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I wonder if it'll stop \Nby the time you go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:39.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I really like the rain \Nwhen I'm inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:42.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I like how it's dark even though it's \Ndaytime, and the sound it makes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:45.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm so glad it's raining \Nfor our at-home date!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:48.36,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But our summer break escape-the-heat \Nstudy session was great, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:50.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's sort of like, \N"So you like them both, then?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:54.62,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs32\an8\c&H9A6ADE&\fad(395,1)\3c&H791786&}SILENCE...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:55.99,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:58.41,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Have I been talking too much for too long?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.29,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I guess I can't criticize my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:02.71,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,And Tani-kun sure is being quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:19.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Um, m-my mom said she'd \Nbring us some snacks later, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:22.56,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,So... what about until then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:25.44,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,And what about after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:29.28,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Miyu, I brought snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:29.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\i1\pos(422.667,38.667)\fad(183,1)\c&H785EED&\an8}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:34.16,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:35.53,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Dear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:38.29,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,Man, the rain made things \Nrougher than expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:40.29,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,so the sandlot ballgame got called off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:44.17,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait! Right now, Miyu \Nhas her boy— a guest in her room!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:45.04,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:56.43,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I know it's late to realize this, but... \NTani-kun's in my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:18:00.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The rain's really coming down, huh? \NI hope it stops before you go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:02.27,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.44,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Uh, did I say that earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:08.44,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do? What should I talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:11.07,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Or should I just be quiet already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:29.92,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to sit over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:31.46,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEFF0FA&\3c&HBD9EE3&\pos(298.667,80)\fad(1,476)}POOF
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:36.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:40.47,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I... would like... to hug.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.36,0:18:53.07,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I have to be careful \Nnot to get lipstick on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:54.28,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H96FFFB&\3c&H750152&\i1\an9\fad(229,1)}WHOA...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.28,Basic Sign,SIGN; box,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\fs16\pos(539.333,338.667)\c&H7A9342&\3c&HC6DFBF&}DISTRACTING\NTHOUGHTS
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:55.95,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,So would I.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:00.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Your heartbeat is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:01.79,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz19.92\pos(150,135.333)\fad(349,1)\c&HAB42E9&}ARE YOU\NDYING...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:01.79,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:06.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Honestly! Tani-kun, \Nyou're so hard to read!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:11.71,Flashback,Tani,0,0,0,,When you're not talking, \NI don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:16.05,Flashback,Tani,0,0,0,,That's the kind of pathetic \Nhuman being I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:20.39,Flashback,Tani,0,0,0,,Would you... be all right with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:24.81,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:27.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:29.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani Yuusuke-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.19,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:34.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yuusuke-kun. Yuusuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:37.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm just trying out \Ndifferent things to call you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.57,0:19:37.82,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(231,1)\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\pos(329.333,83.333)\frz17.63}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:40.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yuu-kun! Yuu-chan! Suke-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:38.28,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\frz341.7\pos(506.666,231.333)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:38.87,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\pos(329.333,83.333)\frz17.63}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:39.28,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\frz341.7\pos(506.666,231.333)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:39.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\pos(329.333,83.333)\frz17.63}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:40.24,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\frz341.7\pos(506.666,231.333)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:40.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\pos(329.333,83.333)\frz17.63}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:41.24,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\frz341.7\pos(506.666,231.333)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.20,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You picked that half?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:41.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\pos(329.333,83.333)\frz17.63}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:42.20,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2FEFE&\3c&HA55AE0&\frz341.7\pos(506.666,231.333)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:47.33,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Miyu-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:49.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's so formal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.33,0:19:51.67,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Miyu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:53.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Whoa! That works!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:54.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Miyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.89,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just can't get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:00.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:04.22,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Oh, that aloha shirt brings back memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:08.52,Default - Top,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,I thought that this way, even if I bump \Ninto Miyu's friend, I won't embarrass her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:08.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,190)\c&H5E2EC6&\fnArial\fs16\pos(460,324.667)}DAD'S VERSION OF STYLISH
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:09.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.98,0:20:12.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun's heading home, \Nso I'll go part of the way—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:17.20,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:20.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:23.41,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,Boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.25,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,What? Boyfriend?! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:29.25,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.25,0:20:30.00,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's Tani.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:31.75,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,No, your first name!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:32.71,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's Yuusuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:35.71,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,Yuusuke-kun! Wow! How old are you? \NWhat school do you go to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:37.88,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Dad! Dad! We'll talk about all that later!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.30,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,What? But I want to know more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:42.55,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,This is why I really didn't \Nwant them to meet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.05,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H7E0576&\frz11.45\pos(130,67.333)\fad(648,267)}AND HIS CLOTHES SEEM TIGHT\NFOR SOME REASON...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:49.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about my mom and \Ndad flapping around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:54.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And you keep laughing about it! Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:56.11,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:58.07,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\frz9.43\pos(403.334,207.334)\3c&HDC5675&\bord1\fad(1,500)}SUZUKI MIYU
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:59.86,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,things like parents and friendships...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:03.62,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,all these different ideas I've had \Nup to now get turned on their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:06.91,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I was thinking, it's just \Nwho you are, Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:12.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? That's so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:15.84,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's like you've read the Suzuki\NKaitai Shinsho, or dissected me like a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:22.34,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Fall is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:25.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,In the summer, it's so muggy\N after the rain stops,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:28.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but when it rains closer to autumn, \Nit really changes the air, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:29.81,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:34.36,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,When our middle school culture festival \Nended, the temperature was like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:37.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,so now, whenever I feel this, like, \Nwhoosh of air changing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:41.57,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I always think, "Ah, the culture festival \Nis done for this year, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:45.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I feel like I'll probably say \Nthe same thing next year, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:49.75,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I think probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.66,0:21:53.88,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,From now on, whenever I feel \Nthis same atmosphere...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.59,0:21:57.46,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I think I'll remember today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:07.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:09.10,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you say something like that to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:14.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,then I'll end up the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.15,0:22:15.23,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Is that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:16.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:18.65,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,Miyu has a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:21.99,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H9DB50A&\pos(281.333,105.333)\fad(483,1)}WOBBLE...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:21.65,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Oh! Please don't drink \Nalcohol before dinner!
